  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, throw this bomb up to 40 feet. Make a ranged attack against a creature or object (improvised weapon). On a hit, roll [[/r 5d8]]. If the target is below one-fourth of its maximum hit points and its remaining hit points are below the number rolled, it falls @condition[unconscious] for 24 hours.</p><p>You can hit a creature with up to three tranq bombs or ammo, adding the totals. After a third miss of the threshold, the creature is immune for 24 hours. Creatures without a capture loot table are immune.</p><p>Foundry: attack and 5d8 roll are automated; apply unconscious / stacking / immunity manually.</p><p><em>Craft (Combo List): Tinker's Tools — Sleep Herb + Bomb Casing DC 15, qty 1.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Tranq Bomb</strong></p>"
    },
